1057:libs/tinyusb/device/usbd.c **** // Reply to a standard GET_STATUS (device/interface/endpoint) with its 2-byte status word.
1058:libs/tinyusb/device/usbd.c **** // GET_STATUS is Device-to-host only; reject a mis-directed (OUT) request rather than handing
1059:libs/tinyusb/device/usbd.c **** // usbd the address of a stack local to write host data into after this frame has returned.
